# rox patch: user shader surfaces (WT-S5).
#
# Widens ShaderParams to time/delta/resolution/mouse/user_meta/signals (128
# bytes), classifies `prev` references at registration and exposes
# Window::user_shader_caps, and adds Window::paint_screen_shader: a real scene
# primitive that makes the renderer re-run a shader over everything composed
# under a bounds, at frame end, with an optional per-instance feedback buffer.
#
# The main pass renders into the post intermediate whenever region entries
# exist or a post shader is installed; regions read rects back out of it in
# paint order and write back scissored; the window post pass runs last. Blade
# only, like the two patches under it.
#
# Applies on top of user-shader-primitive.patch.
